	(text "HIGO MINI B - PIN NUMBERING BY WIRE COLOUR (Velion convention)\nOrder: 1 RED, 2 BLACK, 3 YELLOW, 4 GREEN, 5 BLUE, 6 WHITE\n(skip colours the cable does not have; colour is the reference)\n\n2 PIN: 1 BLK  2 WHT\n3 PIN: 1 RED  2 BLK  3 WHT\n4 PIN: 1 RED  2 BLK  3 YEL  4 GRN\n5 PIN: 1 RED  2 BLK  3 YEL  4 GRN  5 BLU\n6 PIN: 1 RED  2 BLK  3 YEL  4 GRN  5 BLU  6 WHT(centre)\n\nTHROTTLE 390X/376ZX (3P Z309BG)\n 1 RED  +5V\n 2 BLK  GND\n 3 WHT  THROTTLE (0.8-4.2V)\n\nDK370 / DK356 LEFT SWITCH (5P Z509BG)\n 1 RED  BEAM\n 2 BLK  GND\n 3 YEL  HORN\n 4 GRN  TURN_L\n 5 BLU  TURN_R\n\nBRAKE L / R 221PYDJZS (2P Z209BG)\n 1 BLK  GND\n 2 WHT  BRAKE (NO, closed to GND when braking)\n\nSwitch inputs: active low, contact to GND, pull-up 12V on VCU.\nFootprint: place pads from the Higo face-view chart for each size\n(3P runs clockwise on male face, 4-6P counter-clockwise)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.482 273.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "38005d9e-89a8-4367-b31e-a2ff09cddcea")
	)
